  "details": "The \"Apply\" button is disabled on Quest if an avatar lacks a native Quest build, even though its generated Impostor already loads and previews fine in the UI menu. It would be awesome to allow Quest users to click Apply and use the existing Impostor instead of outright blocking the avatar.\n\nFurthermore, VRChat could automatically optimize PC avatars for Quest on the server side: stripping extra polygons, compressing textures, and swapping materials to standard VRChat/Mobile shaders so every avatar remains usable on standalone hardware.",
